{"parse":{"title":"Torchforger's Covenant","pageid":439284,"revid":2074736,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Torchforger&#39;s Covenant</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/7c/Talent_Torchforger%27s_Covenant.png/revision/latest?cb=20260205150401\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Torchforger&#39;s Covenant\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/7c/Talent_Torchforger%27s_Covenant.png/revision/latest?cb=20260205150401\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/7c/Talent_Torchforger%27s_Covenant.png/revision/latest?cb=20260205150401 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/7c/Talent_Torchforger%27s_Covenant.png/revision/latest?cb=20260205150401 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Torchforger&#39;s Covenant\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Torchforger%27s_Covenant.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Torchforger&#39;s Covenant.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Illuga\" title=\"Illuga\">Illuga</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/1st_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"1st Ascension Passive\">1st Ascension Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascension_Talent\" title=\"Ascension Talent\">Ascension</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">After unleashing Elemental Skill <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Dawnbearing Songbird</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Dawnbearing Songbird</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Summons the trusty messenger bird, \"Aedon.\" Different effects are produced depending on whether the skill is Tapped or Held.<br /><br /><b>Tap</b><br />Aedon dashes towards enemies in front, dealing <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo DMG</b></span> to enemies it comes into contact with.<br /><br /><b>Hold</b><br />Enter aiming mode, and command Aedon to dash towards opponents being aimed at, dealing <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo DMG</b></span> to opponents it comes into contact with.</span></span></span> or Elemental Burst <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Shadowless Reflection</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Shadowless Reflection</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Light the lamp, dealing <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>AoE Geo DMG</b></span>, and gain Haunted Night's Oriole-Song effect for 20s. When this effect is active, Illuga gains 21 stacks of Nightingale's Song. It can increase the <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo DMG</b></span> inflicted by current active characters. When Normal Attacks, Charged Attacks, Plunging Attacks, Elemental Skills, and Elemental Bursts of nearby active party members deal <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo DMG</b></span> to opponents, 1 stack of Nightingale’s Song is consumed to increase the DMG dealt. Increase in DMG is based on Illuga’s Elemental Mastery. If DMG is inflicted by Lunar-Crystallize, DMG dealt will increase further.<br />When <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo DMG</b></span> dealt in this manner hits multiple opponents, multiple stacks of Nightingale's Song will be consumed, depending on how many opponents are hit.<br /><br />Additionally, if there are <span class=\"text-geo\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Geo_Construct\" title=\"Geo Construct\">Geo Constructs</a></b></span> created by nearby party members on the battlefield while Illuga unleashes his Elemental Burst, or when nearby party members create <span class=\"text-geo\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Geo_Construct\" title=\"Geo Construct\">Geo Constructs</a></b></span> while Haunted Night's Oriole-Song is active, every <span class=\"text-geo\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Geo_Construct\" title=\"Geo Construct\">Geo Construct</a></b></span> on the battlefield will allow Illuga to gain 5 additional stacks of Nightingale's Song. Within 20s after unleashing his Elemental Burst, Illuga can gain a maximum of 15 additional stacks of Nightingale’s Song this way.<br /><br />When all stacks of Nightingale's Song have been consumed, or when the state's duration ends, the Haunted Night's Oriole-Song effect will end.</span></span></span>, nearby party members will gain the Lightkeeper's Oath effect for 20s: For <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo DMG</b></span> dealt to opponents, <a href=\"/wiki/CRIT_Rate\" title=\"CRIT Rate\">CRIT Rate</a> increases by 5% and <a href=\"/wiki/CRIT_DMG\" title=\"CRIT DMG\">CRIT DMG</a> increases by 10%.<br /><br /><b>Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam</b><br />When party members are affected by the Lightkeeper's Oath effect, <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mastery\" title=\"Elemental Mastery\">Elemental Mastery</a> is increased by 50.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mastery\" title=\"Elemental Mastery\">Elemental Mastery</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/CRIT_Rate\" title=\"CRIT Rate\">CRIT Rate</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/CRIT_DMG\" title=\"CRIT DMG\">CRIT DMG</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Torchforger's Covenant</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Illuga\" title=\"Illuga\">Illuga</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/1st_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"1st Ascension Passive\">1st Ascension Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTorchforger%2527s_Covenant%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dl><dt><big>Constellation Effects</big></dt></dl>\n<ul><li>Constellation Level 6, <span class=\"item constellation\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"20\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nightmare_Orioles\" title=\"Nightmare Orioles\"><img alt=\"Nightmare Orioles\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Nightmare Orioles.png\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Nightmare_Orioles.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/59/Constellation_Nightmare_Orioles.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260205151709\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nightmare_Orioles\" title=\"Nightmare Orioles\"><img alt=\"Nightmare Orioles\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Nightmare Orioles.png\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Nightmare_Orioles.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/59/Constellation_Nightmare_Orioles.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20260205151709\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Nightmare_Orioles\" title=\"Nightmare Orioles\">Nightmare Orioles</a></span></span>: \"Enhances the Lightkeeper's Oath effect of the Ascension Talent <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Torchforger's Covenant</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Torchforger's Covenant</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">After unleashing Elemental Skill <a href=\"/wiki/Dawnbearing_Songbird\" title=\"Dawnbearing Songbird\">Dawnbearing Songbird</a> or Elemental Burst <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowless_Reflection\" title=\"Shadowless Reflection\">Shadowless Reflection</a>, other nearby party members will gain the Lightkeeper's Oath effect for 20s: For <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo DMG</b></span> dealt to opponents, CRIT Rate increases by 5% and CRIT DMG increases by 10%.  <b>Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam</b> Party members affected by the Lightkeeper's Oath effect have their Elemental Mastery increased by 50.</span></span></span>: For <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo DMG</b></span> dealt to opponents, CRIT Rate is increased by 10%, CRIT DMG is increased by 30%.  <b>Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam</b> When characters are affected by Lightkeeper's Oath, Elemental Mastery is increased by 80. You must first unlock the Ascension Talent &#39;Torchforger's Covenant.&#39;\"</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTorchforger%2527s_Covenant%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Torchforger's Covenant</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">铸灯者的盟约</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\"></span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Lantern-Forger's Covenant</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">鑄燈者的盟約</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\"></span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">ライトブリンガーの盟約</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">등</span> <span lang=\"ko\">제작자의</span> <span lang=\"ko\">맹약</span><br /><small><i>Deung Jejakjaui Maeng'yak</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Pacto del Forjador de L<span lang=\"es\">á</span>mparas</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Pacte du forge-torche</td><td>Torchforger's Pact</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Завет</span> <span lang=\"ru\">Литейщика</span> <span lang=\"ru\">факелов</span><br /><small><i>Zavet Liteyshchika fakelov</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Torchforger's Covenant</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Hiệp Ước Người Đúc Đèn</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Pakt der Fackelmacher</td><td>Torchmakers' Pact</td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>Torchforger's Covenant</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>Juramento do Iluminador</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>Me<span lang=\"tr\">ş</span>ale Ustas<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>n<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>n Ahdi</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Patto del Forgialuce</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTorchforger%2527s_Covenant%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/Luna_IV\" title=\"Version/Luna IV\">Version \"Luna IV\"</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Torchforger%27s_Covenant/Change_History?action=edit&amp;preload=Template:Change_History/Preload&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=%22Luna+IV%22&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=Torchforger%27s+Covenant\">Create New History</a>]</div></div></div><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Navigation\">Navigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTorchforger%2527s_Covenant%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"navbox-border navbox\" style=\"border-spacing:0;;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:2px;\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"nowraplinks mw-collapsible navbox-inner\" style=\"border-spacing:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;;\"><tbody><tr><th style=\